From 296c7a4bb9b5687b4521315d5b7948a66606e29c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Do <david.do@openkingdom.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:20:39 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 25/26] check-keys: rename the tool from `kiem-khoa`, and fix a
 comment citing a removed flag
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Chuan hoa toan dien 2026-08-28: dinh danh cua du an chuyen sang tieng Anh.
`kiem-khoa` la cong cu Go DUY NHAT trong `9chain-a1-tools/` con mang ten tieng Viet.

  9chain-a1-tools/kiem-khoa/  ->  9chain-a1-tools/check-keys/
  main.go: 7 lan chuoi `kiem-khoa` (ten binary trong cau tro giup) -> `check-keys`

Kem mot sua nho nhung dung lop loi cua du an: `netgen/allocation.go` dan
`check-consistency.mjs --tu-kiem`, ma co do da doi thanh `--self-test`. Mot chu thich
day nguoi doc toi mot lenh KHONG CON TON TAI thi te hon la khong co chu thich — no
trong nhu mot phep do da duoc kiem chung.

🔴 DAY LA COMMIT THU 25. Luat cung #3 truoc do khai 24 patch / tree 074aaa93. Con so
do PHAI doi cung luc, va doi chung nguoc nay MANH HON ban cu: ap 24/25 patch phai ra
DUNG `074aaa93` — tuc dung cai cay ma image dang chay dung tren.
---
 9chain-a1-tools/{kiem-khoa => check-keys}/main.go | 14 +++++++-------
 9chain-a1-tools/netgen/allocation.go              |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 rename 9chain-a1-tools/{kiem-khoa => check-keys}/main.go (95%)

diff --git a/9chain-a1-tools/kiem-khoa/main.go b/9chain-a1-tools/check-keys/main.go
similarity index 95%
rename from 9chain-a1-tools/kiem-khoa/main.go
rename to 9chain-a1-tools/check-keys/main.go
index 3abd52e..13fcad2 100644
